   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Funktionen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00198\">LinIf_Init</a> (const LinIf_ConfigType* ConfigPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initializes the LIN Interface.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00340\">LinIf_GetVersionInfo</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>* versioninfo);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns the version information of this module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00201\">LinIf_Transmit</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00005\">PduIdType</a> TxPduId, const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00011\">PduInfoType</a>* PduInfoPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Re quests transmission of a PDU.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00202\">LinIf_ScheduleRequest</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, LinIf_SchHandleType Schedule);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Requests a schedule table to be executed.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00204\">LinIf_GotoSleep</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initiates a transition into the Sleep Mode on the selected channel.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00205\">LinIf_Wakeup</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initiates the wake up process.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00544\">LinIf_SetTrcvMode</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, LinTrcv_TrcvModeType TransceiverMode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Set the given LIN transceiver to the given mode.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00545\">LinIf_GetTrcvMode</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, LinTrcv_TrcvModeType* TransceiverModePtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns the actual sta te of a LIN Transceiver Driver.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00547\">LinIf_GetTrcvWakeupReason</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, LinTrcv_TrcvWakeupReasonType* TrcvWuReasonPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns the reason for the wake up that has been detected by the LIN Transceiver Driver.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00550\">LinIf_SetTrcvWakeupMode</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, LinTrcv_TrcvWakeupModeType Lin Trcv WakeupMode);</code> <span class=\"dim\">This API enables, disables and cl ears the notification for wakeup events on the addressed network</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_91002\">LinIf_GetPIDTable</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, Lin_FramePidType* Pid Buffer, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a>* Pid Buffer Length);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Retrieves all assigned PID values.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_91003\">LinIf_SetPIDTable</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, Lin_FramePidType* Pid Buffer, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> Pid Buffer Length);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Sets all assigned PID values.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00829\">LinIf_GetConfiguredNAD</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a>* Nad);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Reports the current configured NAD.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00833\">LinIf_SetConfiguredNAD</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a> Nad);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Sets the current configured NAD.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00350\">LinTp_Init</a> (const LinTp_ConfigType* ConfigPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Initializes the LIN Transport Layer.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00351\">LinTp_Transmit</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00005\">PduIdType</a> TxPduId, const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00011\">PduInfoType</a>* PduInfoPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Requests transmission of a PDU.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00352\">LinTp_GetVersionInfo</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00015\">Std_VersionInfoType</a>* versioninfo);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Returns the version information of this module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00355\">LinTp_Shutdown</a> (void);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Shutdowns the LIN TP.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00501\">LinTp_ChangeParameter</a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00005\">PduIdType</a> id, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00031\">TPParameterType</a> parameter, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00014\">uint16</a> value);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Request to change a specific transport protocol parameter (e.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00378\">LinIf_CheckWakeup</a> (EcuM_WakeupSourceType WakeupSource);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Will be called when the Ecu M has been notified about a wakeup on a specific LIN channel.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00876\">LinIf_EnableBusMirroring</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00026\">boolean</a> Mirroring Active);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Enables or disables mirroring for a LIN channel.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00715\">LinIf_WakeupConfirmation</a> (EcuM_WakeupSourceType WakeupSource);</code> <span class=\"dim\">The LIN Driver or LIN Transceiver Driver will call this function to report the wake up source after the successful wakeup...</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_91004\">LinIf_HeaderIndication</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"lin.html#SWS_Lin_00232\">Lin_PduType</a>* PduPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">The LIN Driver will call this function to report a received LIN header.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_91005\">LinIf_RxIndication</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00013\">uint8</a>* Lin_SduPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">The LIN Driver will call this function to report a successfully received response and provides the reception data to the LIN...</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_91006\">LinIf_TxConfirmation</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel);</code> <span class=\"dim\">The LIN Driver will call this function to report a successfully transmitted response.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_91007\">LinIf_LinErrorIndication</a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, Lin_SlaveErrorType Error Status);</code> <span class=\"dim\">The LIN Driver will call this function to report a detected error event during header or response processing.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> < <<< <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00528\"><User_TriggerTransmit></a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00005\">PduIdType</a> TxPduId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00011\">PduInfoType</a>* PduInfoPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Within this API, the upper layer module (called module) shall check whether the available data fits into the b uffer size...</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <<<< <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00529\"><User_TxConfirmation></a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00005\">PduIdType</a> TxPduId, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"std.html#SWS_Std_00005\">Std_ReturnType</a> result);</code> <span class=\"dim\">The lower layer communication interface module confirms the transmission of a PDU, or the failure to transmit a PDU.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <<<< <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00530\"><User_RxIndication></a> (<a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00005\">PduIdType</a> RxPduId, const <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"comstack.html#SWS_COMTYPE_00011\">PduInfoType</a>* PduInfoPtr);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Indication of a received PDU from a lower layer communication interface module.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">void <<<< <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00856\"><User_ResponseErrorSignalChanged></a> (NetworkHandleType Channel, <a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00026\">boolean</a> Resp Err Sig Value);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Notifies the change of the response error signal with the new value.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"vis-app\" href=\"platform.html#SWS_Platform_00026\">boolean</a> < <<< <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00857\"><User_SaveConfigurationRequest></a> (NetworkHandleType Channel);</code> <span class=\"dim\">Notifies the reception of a Save Configuration request.</span></li>\n</ul>",
