  {
   "t": "html",
   "html": "<h3>Typen — Übersicht</h3>\n<ul class=\"mlist\">\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00197\">LinIf_SchHandleType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">Index of the schedule table that is selectable and followed by LIN Interface.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">struct <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00668\">LinIf_ConfigType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">A pointer to an instance of this structure will be used in the initialization of the LIN Interface.</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\">struct <a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00426\">LinTp_ConfigType</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This is the base type for the configuration of the LIN Transport Protocol A pointer to an instance of this structure will be...</span></li>\n  <li><code class=\"sig\"><a class=\"fn\" href=\"#SWS_LinIf_00629\">LinTp_Mode</a></code> <span class=\"dim\">This type denotes which Schedule table can be requested by LIN TP during diagnostic session</span></li>\n</ul>",
